# PreToolUse (Read) sensitive file patterns
# Format: id@@regex@@message (delimiter: @@)
# Patterns match against the file_path being read.
# Advisory only — warns but never blocks.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are skipped.

env-file@@(^|/)\.env(\.|$)@@Reading environment file -- secrets may enter context window
key-file@@\.(key|pem|p12|pfx)$@@Reading cryptographic key file -- review before proceeding
credentials@@(^|/)credentials@@Reading credentials file -- secrets may enter context window
secrets-path@@(^|/)secrets?[/.]@@Reading file with 'secret' in path -- verify no credentials leak
id-rsa@@(^|/)id_(rsa|dsa|ecdsa|ed25519)@@Reading SSH private key -- this should not be in context
htpasswd@@(^|/)\.htpasswd@@Reading htpasswd file -- password hashes may enter context
